{"name": "Axion Racer", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thrill-seekers and speed demons, wait no longer and dive into the universe of AXION RACER! Take part in ultra-fast futuristic races against a grid of fierce opponents across a dozen varied environments, including deserts, lush forests, and neon cities where loopings, barrel rolls, and high-flying jumps await. Powered by an advanced physics engine, boost, drift, and slam into your rivals to emerge victorious. Unapologetically arcade, you will be thrown into insane races reaching speeds of up to 2,000 km/h! Are you ready?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BECOME A TRUE AXION RACER</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Master your Boost</strong> \u2013 The key to winning on the track: Boost, Cool down, Win \ud83c\udfc6!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Master 3 difficulty levels</strong> \u2013 Prove your skills across 3 speed classes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>12 original tracks</strong> \u2013 Race through a variety of unique environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3 championships</strong> \u2013 Conquer them all and become the ultimate <i>AXION RACER</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>12 unique ship models</strong> \u2013 Each with its own distinct handling style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/5ef3297cbcee8041008167f638d3b976.poster.avif?t=1787844818\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/5ef3297cbcee8041008167f638d3b976.webm?t=1787844818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/5ef3297cbcee8041008167f638d3b976.mp4?t=1787844818\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The BOOST button allows you to reach phenomenal speeds up to 2,000 km/h in real speed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"32\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/abd2e0915c2e35533126de2cb8b2977b.webp?t=1787844818\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/3d136d4038c70e938cc2f31fcef6d54a.poster.avif?t=1787844818\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/3d136d4038c70e938cc2f31fcef6d54a.webm?t=1787844818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/3d136d4038c70e938cc2f31fcef6d54a.mp4?t=1787844818\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Even in mid-flight, your ship's physics allow you to smoothly use airbrakes and steering to glide and land on the runway.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"32\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/abd2e0915c2e35533126de2cb8b2977b.webp?t=1787844818\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/f1bcad76434b281062c06c3f4567a9eb.poster.avif?t=1787844818\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/f1bcad76434b281062c06c3f4567a9eb.webm?t=1787844818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/f1bcad76434b281062c06c3f4567a9eb.mp4?t=1787844818\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Collisions damage your ship, the repair bonus allows you to reduce this damage.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"32\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/abd2e0915c2e35533126de2cb8b2977b.webp?t=1787844818\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/3a46fdcf045a59a4d178c024573b0d55.poster.avif?t=1787844818\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/3a46fdcf045a59a4d178c024573b0d55.webm?t=1787844818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/3a46fdcf045a59a4d178c024573b0d55.mp4?t=1787844818\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><strong>Keep an eye on your boost gauge ! Excessive overheating drains your health bar... and that could prove fatal !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"32\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/abd2e0915c2e35533126de2cb8b2977b.webp?t=1787844818\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/82d8486622ca5d33a6b457c67f8e48b3.poster.avif?t=1787844818\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/82d8486622ca5d33a6b457c67f8e48b3.webm?t=1787844818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/82d8486622ca5d33a6b457c67f8e48b3.mp4?t=1787844818\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Using the BOOST can cause your engine to overheat; fortunately, the \"Frost\" BONUS allows you to cool it down instantly.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"32\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/abd2e0915c2e35533126de2cb8b2977b.webp?t=1787844818\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/ef38c110e75b8656693d8c0de32d7184.poster.avif?t=1787844818\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/ef38c110e75b8656693d8c0de32d7184.webm?t=1787844818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/ef38c110e75b8656693d8c0de32d7184.mp4?t=1787844818\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Mega-Boost bonus significantly increases your speed for a short period of time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"32\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/abd2e0915c2e35533126de2cb8b2977b.webp?t=1787844818\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/8c947b2e58e36ba5035eeac0ae93dd04.poster.avif?t=1787844818\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/8c947b2e58e36ba5035eeac0ae93dd04.webm?t=1787844818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/8c947b2e58e36ba5035eeac0ae93dd04.mp4?t=1787844818\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>True Axion Racers know it well: combining boost and airbrakes lets you drift at high speeds !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"32\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/abd2e0915c2e35533126de2cb8b2977b.webp?t=1787844818\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>VARIOUS GAME MODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/6d48c1b1139405f44be9ab1d4ab26310.avif?t=1787844818\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Championships</strong> \u2013 Claim top spot at the end of 4 intense races.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Single Race</strong> \u2013 Hone your piloting skills to dominate the championships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Time Trial</strong> \u2013 Go head-to-head with the clock and set a new personal record.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/14d3a343d0e3df8cd04488b0b9701ca4.avif?t=1787844818\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An intuitive and fast arcade-style menu.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Custom synthwave soundtracks designed for every track.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock tracks and earn new ships.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/34de4dace36fd6963b14f7eadfa95b99.avif?t=1787844818\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/extras/8ae389da8bf2dc74a3b2537604545e42.avif?t=1787844818\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Thrill-seekers and speed demons, wait no longer and dive into the universe of AXION RACER! Take part in ultra-fast futuristic races against a grid of fierce opponents across a dozen varied environments.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4924800/8ac9a1e9dca072cfc4271895294511f0df6b1c02/header.jpg?t=1787844818", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Racing", "Arcade", "Third Person", "Score Attack", "Singleplayer", "Cyberpunk"], "developers": "TRIVECTOR", "publishers": "TRIVECTOR", "release_date": "Aug 6, 2026", "price": "$14.99", "appid": "4924800", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "9 S